# Default set of translation models to download.
#
# One zip filename per line. The language pair is the first 7 characters of
# the filename (e.g. "eng-cat"), which is also the directory name the model
# extracts to and the key the translation service uses.
#
# Comment out a line to exclude a model, or use MODELS="eng-cat cat-eng ..."
# to download only a subset of the pairs listed here. See models/download-models.sh.

